{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "136",
 "name": "Vela'Tohr Overlook",
 "file": "Map136_VelaTohr_Overlook.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":60,"y":40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Canopied Trail","descriptions":["Towering ironwoods spread their canopies over the stunted oaks and scrubby pines, the sparsely leafed limbs interlacing in a web of rot-riddled wood that hangs low over the narrow ridge rising up from the forest floor.  A few of the lower branches of the trees are broken, as if something large had passed this way recently."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":28,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":2,"x":80,"y":20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Withered Foothills","descriptions":["Bent and twisted by strong mountain winds, an ambitious copse of witchclaw trees struggles along the sloping rise.  Huddled in solitude at the edge of the ridge overlooking the tangle, a scraggly pine draped with veils of crone's hair moss broods over its reflection in a dark pool."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":3,"x":60,"y":0,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Withered Foothills","descriptions":["A stand of blanched and bare birch struggles to survive in the stony ground as the path climbs up the sparsely wooded rise.  The air lacks the rich scents of earth, loam and decay while underfoot the land is sere, showing evidence of a blight terrible enough to bleed the very life from the land."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":4,"x":40,"y":-20,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Withered Foothills","descriptions":["Curiously washed-out hues paint the landscape in stark and pallid detail.  Grass bleached to straw barely binds the soil together in the face of eroding winds and ice melt.  The trees growing on either side of the rutted track are stunted and spindly, roots exposed where exhausted earth has crumbled beneath the onslaught of the elements."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":5,"x":40,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Withered Foothills","descriptions":["With the ridge dropping sharply towards the forest below, the narrow track hugs the mountain looming to the north.  Tenacious scrub pines cling to the stony ground, growing in defiance of strong winds and occasional rockslides.  Stubborn ice fills shadowed clefts in the granite cliffs.","Clinging precariously to the stony ground, scrub pines sway and rustle in time with the fickle wind.  Pebbles shift alarmingly underfoot and a few skitter over the edge of the ridge, a perilous reminder of rockslides.  Stubborn ice glints dully from the shadowed clefts in the granite cliffs."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":51,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":6,"x":20,"y":-60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Withered Foothills","descriptions":["Amidst this desolation of skeletal trees and barren crags, Asketi's Mount dominates the view as it thrusts skyward.  When the wind blows from the north, long plumes of snow fly from the high peak like banners.  A rough trail disappears beyond a switchback upslope from here.","The distant sound of falling rocks echoes faintly from above where something makes it way along the heights.  Amidst this desolation of skeletal trees and barren crags, a rough trail leads up the mountain, vanishing into the dark."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":7,"x":20,"y":-80,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Withered Foothills","descriptions":["A lone vela'tohr plant grows stoically amidst hard packed ground comprised of small pebbles and stone, tiny remnants from the mountain that looms above it.  It stands, a vigilant sentinel, before a rough trail that leads back to a denser part of the woods."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":8,"x":0,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Withered Foothills","descriptions":["Small rugged pebbles and sharp rock splinters scatter the area, runoff from the majestic mountain towering above.  Random spots of green -- vegetation battling with the debris it's buried in -- offer muted color amidst the drab shards."],"exits":[{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":9,"x":-20,"y":-100,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Withered Foothills","descriptions":["Partially obscured by the rock and crushed stone is the beginning of a steep switchback trail ascending upwards.  High overhead, rocky shelves and occasional overhangs mar the treacherous sides of the looming cliff that rises skyward."],"exits":[{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":10,"x":-20,"y":-120,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Rocky Cliff","descriptions":["A steep switchback trail from the foothills below ends abruptly on a small plateau.  Dead brush and thorny bushes partially obscure a crumbling path that continues the ascent up the mountainside.  The rocky ground is swept clean of the usual fallen debris by the strong gusts of wind whipping around the cliff edge.  No leaves or twigs crunch underfoot and the lack of scent normally associated with growing vegetation leaves the area feeling curiously sterile."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":11,"x":-20,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Overlook, Precarious Shelf","descriptions":["A crumbling path arises from the foothills below, opening onto a rather large rocky shelf.  Pieces of charred wood sitting within a circle of rocks give testament to previous hikers' campfires."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":12,"x":0,"y":-140,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Overlook, Precarious Shelf","descriptions":["Scraggly clumps of sirese flowers, partially protected by the rising cliff, grow bravely amidst the accumulation of rubble scattered haphazardly on the hard ground.  Horizontal cracks striate the cliff -- strange handprints left by nature along the coarse stone wall."],"exits":[{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":13,"x":0,"y":-160,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Overlook, Rocky Cliff","descriptions":["Horizontal cracks rive the rock face below, offering scant finger- and toeholds.  The slope rising above this small ledge angles inward for a slightly easier climb.  Crumbling stone and small pebbles trickle down the cliff, careening and echoing noisily as they make their rapid descent.  The temperature begins to drop considerably in the higher altitude."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":14,"x":0,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Overlook, Cliff's Edge","descriptions":["A thin layer of frost streaks the cliffside, creating a somewhat more treacherous climb on the rocky slope leading downwards.  The wind howls forlornly, lovingly embracing courageous climbers in an icy grasp as it fills the air with eerie laments."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":13,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":15,"x":-20,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Vela'Tohr Overlook","descriptions":["Glimmers of blue-white frost soften the stark lines of the bare stone underfoot.  Nature's hand has carved a vast plateau from the cliffs that overlook the Vela'Tohr Woods.  Directly below, twisted skeletal trees huddle against the granite crags as if seeking protection from the icy winds that whistle down from the passes.  The Woods spread south and west, growing noticeably lusher further away from the mountain.  Far in the distance, the Liirewsag River can be seen winding its way towards Sawstwar Lake.","Cold air sinks from above, chilling the bare stone underfoot.  Nature's hand has carved a vast plateau from the cliffs that overlook the Vela'Tohr Woods.  The night sky and mountain's shadows conspire to obscure the source of a muffled clattering punctuated with sharp pops and snaps."],"exits":[{"to":14,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":16,"x":-40,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Vela'Tohr Overlook","descriptions":["Narrow shelves and dark fissures riddle the jagged cliffs looming above, offering temporary relief for those who dare the ascent of the towering mountain.  Although the stone rises sheer here and offers no holds, an icy crevice that has opened in the mountain wall invites any would-be climbers to explore.  Strong winds buffet even the most tenacious traveler, threatening to remove all in its path in order to restore the sterile beauty of frozen stone."],"exits":[{"to":15,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":27,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":17,"x":-60,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Vela'Tohr Overlook","descriptions":["Deep gouges formed by wind and ice mar the hard granite of the mountainside.  Rivulets of water that have dribbled down from these small crevices are forever frozen, forming strangely shaped ice sculptures upon the sleek rock."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":18,"x":-100,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Vela'Tohr Overlook","descriptions":["A massive rockslide hinders easy travel to the north, partially sheltering the area from the bitterly cold winds.  The ground has been cleared of rubble and a few flat boulders are scattered randomly in small groupings."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":26,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":19,"x":-120,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Vela'Tohr Overlook","descriptions":["Frigid winds caress the area with icy fingertips, leaving traces of rimy fingerprints upon the hard rock.  Icy pebbles and small stones litter the frozen ground like shattered pieces of cut glass."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":20,"x":-140,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Vela'Tohr Overlook","descriptions":["The cold wind screams relentlessly, sending pebbled shards and icy gravel skittering across the frozen ground.  Powerful gusts cause even the strongest of hunters to sway precariously -- a false step would result in a very long fall."],"exits":[{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":21,"x":-160,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Overhang","descriptions":["Dead timber, perhaps stacked by previous hunters, is encased in ice and creates a snowy fence.  Strategically placed in relation to the steady wind currents, it provides a formidable barricade on the western edge of the overlook."],"exits":[{"to":20,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":22,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":22,"x":-180,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Dark Burrows","descriptions":["Poorly tanned hides have been stretched over tall wooden poles to form a windbreak around a jagged fissure.  Dry flakes of snow swirl into the tunnel with each gust of wind.  Footprints on the dusty stone floor bear mute witness to others who have passed this way.  The passage narrows slightly as it inclines steeply downward, away from the fissure."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":21,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map135_Dark_Burrows.xml"},
  {"id":23,"x":-100,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Vela'Tohr Overlook","descriptions":["Light dustings of snow swirl upwards in odd shapes as tiny eddies sporadically shift and spin the white particles in all directions.  Occasionally, several of these unusual shapes group together and sprint across the frozen ground like deformed rabbits fleeing from an angry beast."],"exits":[{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":19,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":24,"x":-80,"y":-200,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Vela'Tohr Overlook","descriptions":["Shattered pieces of granite, finely dusted with tiny flecks of crystal, are strewn along the ground and encased in thin films of ice.  Occasionally, additional pieces careen down the mountainside, skittering to an abrupt halt to lie amidst the rocky debris that has accumulated."],"exits":[{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":25,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":25,"x":-60,"y":-180,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Vela'Tohr Overlook","descriptions":["A set of rusted crampons with rotting leather straps is half buried beneath a large ice-covered granite boulder surrounded by oddly shaped clumps of snow.  Packed with particles of granite and frozen twigs, the wind has molded the hard-packed snow into sculptured creatures -- malformed and strangely menacing."],"exits":[{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":23,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":26,"x":-100,"y":-240,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Cliff Base","descriptions":["A massive rockslide comprised of broken boulders and ice-covered granite rock ends abruptly against the mountainside.  Looming above is a completely vertical, unscalable cliff, its sides coated with solid ice.  Enclosed on three sides, this small area is sheltered from the omnipresent wind scouring the rest of the mountain."],"exits":[{"to":18,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":27,"x":-20,"y":-220,"z":0,"title":"Hag's Crag, Glacial Precipice","descriptions":["Rocks and boulders slick with hoarfrost have made their home on a small shelf and partially obscure an icy crevice that leads to the overlook below.  Scant, unidentifiable vegetation -- blighted leaves entombed in a frosty glaze -- huddle against the leeward side of some of the larger boulders."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":16,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map137_Hags_Crag.xml"},
  {"id":28,"x":40,"y":60,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Blighted Tangle","descriptions":["A ridge heaves up sharply from the forest floor, a long rise of stone and earth curved like a claw.  Trees cling to its flanks, their leafy canopies shrouding the world in grey twilight.  Smelling of crisp pine and the less pleasant scent of decay, pale mists rise from the black earth and curl through the scatter of rocks and trees."],"exits":[{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map134_Blighted_Tangle.xml"},
  {"id":51,"x":0,"y":-40,"z":0,"title":"Vela'Tohr Woods, Box Canyon","descriptions":["Gutted from the mountain by wind and ice, the granite walls of the canyon pinch inward overhead to create scant shelter from the elements.  Powdery grey moss dapples the lower surfaces and the ground is carpeted with wind-blown dirt and leaves.  Chilly gusts whistle through the narrow opening to the south, carrying a faint scent of pine sap.  To the north, the cleft narrows further to form a tunnel leading deeper into the mountain."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF","linksTo":"Map135_Dark_Burrows.xml"}
 ],
 "labels": []
}
